      "id": "kb-fin-001#chunk-1",
      "docId": "kb-fin-001",
      "chunkIndex": 1,
      "text": "Cyber criminals are circulating deceptive SMS and WhatsApp messages claiming that user YONO bank accounts have been blocked due to outdated KYC documents and urging recipients to click external links under threat of financial penalty. The Reserve Bank of India and SBI emphasize that banks will never ask customers to verify passwords, debit card PINs, CVV, or one-time passwords through SMS web links.",
