      "id": "kb-gov-001#chunk-0",
      "docId": "kb-gov-001",
      "chunkIndex": 0,
      "text": "A message is circulating on social media claiming that the Government of India is providing free laptops to all students. This claim is FAKE. No such scheme is being operated by the central government. Fraudulent messages frequently share deceptive web addresses claiming that students who passed 10th or 12th standards can register for free laptops by submitting Aadhaar numbers and personal contact information.",
      "source_name": "PIB Fact Check (Government of India)",
      "url": "https://factcheck.pib.gov.in/",
      "published_date": "2021-11-04",
      "trust_tier": "TIER_1_OFFICIAL_GOV",
      "domain": "pib.gov.in",
      "title": "PIB Fact Check: Viral Messages Claiming Free Laptop Distribution Under Government Scheme Are Fake",
